&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KRAUSE Automation GmbH&lt;/strong&gt; ist ein weltweit agierender Anbieter innovativer Automatisierungslösungen. Mit technischem Know-how, modernsten Technologien und maßgeschneiderten Systemen unterstützen wir unsere Kunden weltweit dabei, ihre Produktionsprozesse effizienter und zukunftssicher zu gestalten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zur Verstärkung unseres Marketingteams suchen wir eine*n Praktikant*in&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(m/w/d) im Bereich Internationales Marketing &amp;amp; Eventmanagement&lt;/strong&gt;. Du unterstützt uns bei der Planung und Umsetzung internationaler Messeauftritte, Kundenveranstaltungen und Marketingprojekte. Dabei arbeitest du eng mit unseren internationalen Niederlassungen sowie externen Partnerunternehmen und Dienstleistenden zusammen und sammelst wertvolle Praxiserfahrung im internationalen B2B-Marketing und Projektmanagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung bei der Planung, Organisation und Nachbereitung internationaler Fachmessen, Kundenveranstaltungen und interner Events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Koordination eventbezogener Aktivitäten mit unseren internationalen Standorten, um eine einheitliche Planung und Kommunikation sicherzustellen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zusammenarbeit mit Agenturen, Messeveranstaltern und weiteren Dienstleistern zur erfolgreichen Umsetzung globaler Veranstaltungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung und Aufbereitung von Präsentationen, Newslettern, Eventmaterialien sowie weiteren Marketinginhalten in deutscher und englischer Sprache&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung bei der Pflege und Aktualisierung unserer Website sowie bei ausgewählten Social-Media-Aktivitäten rund um internationale Events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Durchführung von Markt- und Wettbewerbsrecherchen sowie administrative Unterstützung bei internationalen Marketingprojekten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laufendes oder abgeschlossenes Studium im Bereich Marketing, Betriebswirtschaft, Eventmanagement, Kommunikation oder eines vergleichbaren Studiengangs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte Organisations- und Kommunikationsfähigkeiten sowie eine selbstständige und strukturierte Arbeitsweise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freude an der Zusammenarbeit in einem internationalen Umfeld und an der Abstimmung mit Teams verschiedener Länder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherer Umgang mit den gängigen Microsoft-Office-Anwendungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interesse an B2B-Marketing und technischen Produkten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erste Erfahrungen mit Content-Erstellung, Social Media oder Website-Pflege&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hohe Eigeninitiative sowie eine lösungsorientierte Denkweise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamgeist und Freude daran, eigene Ideen einzubringen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Engine Orchestration team builds and operates the distributed services that run, scale and balance the analytical query engines. We are the layer that turns a customer&#39;s model into something they and their AI agents can query interactively using our Process Query Language across enterprise-sized datasets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team actively evolves our new premium query engine, collaborating with multiple other teams across time zones. New features, improved operationability, robust security, and allowing for scalable customer workloads are ours to design and ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our defining program right now is a multi-year migration of the query engine that has powered Celonis for years onto our new premium query engine. It is one of the largest and highest-leverage engineering efforts in the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer to lead both the engineering that evolves the new premium query engine and the execution of milestones within the migration program that moves customer workloads onto it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a lift and shift. The two query engines evolved with different focus areas and the new premium query engine serves different forward looking use cases, so the job is keeping customer workloads running seamlessly throughout. You will analyze how the engines differ on real customer workloads, develop tooling, classify the root causes, and turn them into concrete follow up actions across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuous operations are a crucial part of your job. You will help keep the engines and their orchestration healthy while the entire fleet moves underneath them, because a migration on this scale does not get a pause in customer traffic to work with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work at Celonis will directly impact companies and people around the globe as they improve their processes to save money, reduce waste, improve automation and generally become more efficient.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of the services our team owns across new and existing microservices in Java, Spring, RabbitMQ and Postgres, from architecture through to production operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the new premium query engine by owning and delivering entire feature sets addressing new and extended use cases, tightened security robustness, and closing gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive query engine migration milestones end to end and ensure operationability across&amp;nbsp; their shared libraries as dependency workflows grow more frequent and complex&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and extend AI agent tooling to carry repetitive operational and development processes across our team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustain the operational and security robustness of our Tier 0 and Tier 1 services throughout feature development and the migration, and take part and improve how the on-call rotation works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;University degree in Computer Science or comparable education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience building Java applications that are scalable, reliable and testable, including owning it in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Java and Python is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with data-intensive, performance-critical distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience rolling out changes across a large fleet of distributed systems, and the instinct for incremental, reversible, measurable steps that comes with it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing and operating systems that process data workloads at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of data structures and algorithms from a performance point of view, and of asynchronous and concurrent programming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to turn a vague, customer-facing problem into a concrete executable plan, and to explain that plan to stakeholders who are not engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English, German is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred experience: Java Spring Boot, Kubernetes, Databases, C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the GTM Sales Enablement team. The global GTM Sales Enablement team empowers internal Sales Celonauts to acquire role-specific knowledge and develop the skills to drive business growth. We do that through the design and execution of innovative sales onboarding and learning journeys, GTM in-person events and interactive workshops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will build and refine a new world-class onboarding engine that translates complex process analytics into repeatable sales success. You will serve as the architect of a new Account Executive’s first 90 days, ensuring they decrease time-to-productivity and possess the skills, product knowledge, and confidence required to achieve their quotas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will achieve this through the design, delivery, and ongoing coaching of our sales onboarding programs for newly hired Account Executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the new AE Onboarding Journey: design, execute, and continuously optimize a comprehensive 30-60-90 day onboarding program for Commercial and Enterprise Account Executives globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Celonis specific junior sales executives yearly talent program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge Technical &amp;amp; Value Selling: Teach new hires how to navigate complex enterprise ecosystems (ERP, CRM, Supply Chain) and effectively position the Celonis AI Platform business case to C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed Sales Methodology (e.g., MEDDPICC) seamlessly into the onboarding curriculum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate &amp;amp; Coach: Lead high-impact live training sessions, workshops, boot camps, and role-play certifications focused on discovery, pitching, and negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure &amp;amp; Iterate: Define, track, and report on key onboarding metrics, such as time-to-first-deal and core competency milestones, leveraging data to constantly refine the program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate Across GTM: Partner closely with Sales Leadership, Product Marketing, Revenue Operations, and Product teams to align onboarding content with shifting business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on the Celonis product, use cases, and value proposition to know what “good” looks like and align the enablement accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a data-based approach in conjunction with the Enablement Analytics team, reviewing, measuring, and evaluating enablement impact in the region in order to foster a continuous improvement philosophy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Sales, Marketing, or a related field; an MBA or advanced degree is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Sales Enablement, Program Management, or a quota-carrying enterprise B2B sales role (AE or BDR) within a high-growth SaaS, data, or cloud infrastructure company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly master the Celonis platform and articulate data architecture, process analytics, and workflow automation in clear business-value terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern enablement tech stacks (e.g., Highspot, Seismic, Salesforce, or modern LMS platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Exceptional presentation, storytelling, and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a high-velocity, fast-paced environment with evolving priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to key locations where in-person training sessions are conducted (primarily Munich and the US East Coast).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in written and spoken English; proficiency in additional languages such as German, French, or Spanish is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The unique opportunity to work within a new category of technology, Execution Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investment in your personal growth and skill development (clear career paths, internal mobility opportunities, L&amp;amp;D platform, mentorships, and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great compensation and benefits packages (equity (restricted stock units), life insurance, time off, generous leave for new parents from day one, and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physical and mental well-being support (subsidized gym membership, access to counseling, virtual events on well-being topics, and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A global and growing team of Celonauts from diverse backgrounds to learn from and work with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An open-minded culture with innovative, autonomous teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Resource Groups to help you feel connected, valued and seen (Black@Celonis, Women@Celonis, Parents@Celonis, Pride@Celonis, Resilience@Celonis, and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear set of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/company/values/&quot;&gt;company values&lt;/a&gt; that guide everything we do: Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
