&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Events &amp;amp; Webinars:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in planning, setting up, and executing regional field marketing events, webinars, and trade shows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account-Based Marketing (ABM):&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with DACH Field Marketing Managers to plan and execute targeted ABM initiatives for key enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Management &amp;amp; Sales Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with the BDR organization on lead routing, campaign follow-ups, and pipeline tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Research &amp;amp; Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify 3rd-party industry events, media publications, and sponsorship opportunities across Germany, Austria, and Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Track and analyze event and campaign performance metrics to inform future marketing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localization &amp;amp; Asset Creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with global demand generation teams and external agencies to localize marketing collaterals and use-case campaigns for the DACH market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Enrolled student (Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s) in Marketing, Business Administration, Communications, Public Relations, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Native or business-fluent &lt;strong&gt;German&lt;/strong&gt; and fluent &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; (written and spoken).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to work from our &lt;strong&gt;Munich Headquarters&lt;/strong&gt; for minimum 6 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong organizational skills, attention to detail, proactive attitude, and interest in B2B tech/SaaS marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus / Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience with campaign management, event execution, and (marketing) tools (e.g., Salesforce, ON24, Gemini, Claude, Google Suite) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
